 "title": "O’Reilly animals",
 "hook": "More than 1,000 illustrated animals have graced the covers of O’Reilly Media’s technical books. The publisher hosts an online “menagerie” where you can browse the pairings; it doesn’t provide downloads, but brian d foy, author of several O’Reilly books, has written a Perl tutorial on how to scrape it, and has shared the results.",
